  m_Name: Story_son
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NpcStoryArc
  npcId: son
  title: The Reluctant Heir
  summary: 'Everybody thinks Ji-ho is lazy. He''s actually great with numbers and people; he just doesn''t want his parents'' life. Fork: take a business course in the city, or stay and modernise the store his way (the games corner).'
  pathAName: The business course
  pathBName: Stay and change the store
  parts:
